{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>今日（28日）下午2時05分左右，警方接獲多宗報案，指屯門建發里2號華運工業大廈外牆棚網起火。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊，約2時40分將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，約200人自行疏散到安全位置。據現場消息，大廈多層用作洗衣用途，起火原因係有待消防調查。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.611466+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:14:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T08:09:16.456773+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:46.551229+00:00","content_hash":"067e96aad24a776ad0af12691fab30524707b6848eb79c2be097e249dee88e6a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}